s=\"image\" href=\"/footer/footer-img-3.jpg\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"/footer/footer-img-4.jpg\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"/footer/footer-img-5.jpg\"/><title>Dootsie&#x27;s</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Coming soon\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.png\"/><meta name=\"next-size-adjust\" content=\"\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0cz1d0mv5g_q7.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"host_grotesk_fd576203-module__CLSZ-a__variable dm_mono_28932917-module__KZKZgW__variable\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><nav class=\"nav-bar\"><div class=\"nav-logo\"><a href=\"/\"><img src=\"/Dootsies.PNG\" alt=\"Dootsie&#x27;s\"/></a></div><div class=\"nav-toggle\"><p id=\"nav-toggle-open\">Menu</p><p id=\"nav-toggle-close\">Close</p></div></nav><div class=\"nav-menu-overlay\"><div class=\"nav-menu-content\"><div class=\"nav-menu-items\"><div class=\"nav-col-lg\"><div class=\"nav-preview-img\"><img src=\"/menu/menu-home.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></div></div><div class=\"nav-col-sm\"><div class=\"nav-menu-links\"><div class=\"nav-link\"><a href=\"/\" data-img=\"/menu/menu-home.jpg\">Home</a></div><div class=\"nav-link\"><a href=\"/about\" data-img=\"/menu/menu-essence.jpg\">Essence</a></div><div class=\"nav-link\"><a href=\"/menu\" data-img=\"/menu/menu-carte.jpg\">Carte</a></div><div class=\"nav-link\"><a href=\"/reservation\" data-img=\"/menu/menu-book.jpg\">Book</a></div></div><div class=\"nav-menu-socials\"><div class=\"nav-social\"><a href=\"#\">Instagram</a></div><div class=\"nav-social\"><a href=\"#\">Google</a></div><div class=\"nav-social\"><a href=\"#\">OpenTable</a></div></div></div></div><div class=\"nav-menu-footer\"><p class=\"sm\"><span>Since 2026</span></p><p class=\"sm\"><span>Greenville, SC</span></p></div></div></div><div class=\"page\"><div class=\"page-wrapper\"><section class=\"about-hero\"><div class=\"about-hero-pin\"><div class=\"hero-heading\"><div data-copy-wrapper=\"true\"><h1 class=\"heading-line-1\">Dootsie&#x27;s</h1><h1 class=\"heading-line-3\">Story</h1></div></div><div class=\"hero-image\"><img src=\"/about/about-hero.jpg\" alt=\"About Dootsie&#x27;s\"/></div></div></section><section class=\"about-info\"><div class=\"container\"><div data-copy-wrapper=\"true\"><p class=\"mono\">Defined by Balance and Restraint</p><h3>Dootsie&#x27;s is an exercise in quiet composition, where space, light, and material come together with deliberate restraint.</h3><h3>In the same spirit, the menu follows a measured approach, guided by balance, clarity, and precision. Each element is considered, each plate composed to feel complete yet effortless.</h3></div></div></section><section class=\"image-banner\"><div class=\"image-banner-bg\"><img src=\"/about/about-image-banner.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></div><div class=\"container\"><div data-copy-wrapper=\"true\"><h4>More</h4><h4>Than</h4><h4>Stay</h4></div><div class=\"image-banner-footer\"><p>Dootsie&#x27;s, every detail is designed to make you feel at home with the elegance of Florence just beyond your door.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"marquee\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"marquee-content\"><h1>Since 1984</h1><h3>Art of Stillness</h3></div><div class=\"marquee-pill\"><div class=\"marquee-track\"><span class=\"marquee-item\">Enduring Taste</span><span class=\"marquee-item\">Enduring Taste</span><span class=\"marquee-item\">Enduring Taste</span><span class=\"marquee-item\">Enduring Taste</span><span class=\"marquee-item\">Enduring Taste</span><span class=\"marquee-item\">Enduring Taste</span><span class=\"marquee-item\">Enduring Taste</span><span class=\"marquee-item\">Enduring Taste</span><span class=\"marquee-item\">Enduring Taste</span><span class=\"marquee-item\">Enduring Taste</span><span class=\"marquee-item\">Enduring Taste</span><span class=\"marquee-item\">Enduring Taste</span></div></div></div></section><div class=\"sticky-cards\"><div class=\"sticky-card\"><div class=\"sticky-card-img\"><img src=\"/about/sticky-card-1.jpg\" alt=\"The Craft\"/></div><h3>The Craft</h3><p>Guided by quiet precision, each plate is shaped with intention, allowing technique and creativity to meet in a calm balance.</p></div><div class=\"sticky-card\"><div class=\"sticky-card-img\"><img src=\"/about/sticky-card-2.jpg\" alt=\"The Beginning\"/></div><h3>The Beginning</h3><p>What started as a simple pursuit of honesty in cooking became a space where detail, warmth, and restraint define every moment.</p></div><div class=\"sticky-card\"><div class=\"sticky-card-img\"><img src=\"/about/sticky-card-3.jpg\" alt=\"The Experience\"/></div><h3>The Experience</h3><p>An atmosphere composed of light, texture, and stillness invites every sense to settle in, creating a presence that lingers.</p></div><div class=\"sticky-card\"><div class=\"sticky-card-img\"><img src=\"/about/sticky-card-4.jpg\" alt=\"The Flavors\"/></div><h3>The Flavors</h3><p>Seasonal ingredients are treated with clarity and respect, forming subtle layers that reveal themselves slowly with each bite.</p></div><div class=\"sticky-card\"><div class=\"sticky-card-img\"><img src=\"/about/sticky-card-5.jpg\" alt=\"The Future\"/></div><h3>The Future</h3><p>With curiosity as its compass, the kitchen continues to evolve, exploring new ideas while honoring the foundations that shaped it.</p></div><div class=\"sticky-card\"><div class=\"sticky-card-img\"><img src=\"/about/sticky-card-6.jpg\" alt=\"The Legacy\"/></div><h3>The Legacy</h3><p>Built one dish at a time, the restaurant&#x27;s story reflects years of dedication, forming a quiet tradition that endures with grace.</p></div></div><section class=\"chefs\"><div class=\"chefs-avatars\"><div class=\"chefs-avatar\"><img src=\"/chefs/avatar1.jpg\" alt=\"Laurent\"/></div><div class=\"chefs-avatar\"><img src=\"/chefs/avatar2.jpg\" alt=\"Camille\"/></div><div class=\"chefs-avatar\"><img src=\"/chefs/avatar3.jpg\" alt=\"Nicolas\"/></div><div class=\"chefs-avatar\"><img src=\"/chefs/avatar4.jpg\" alt=\"Isabelle\"/></div><div class=\"chefs-avatar\"><img src=\"/chefs/avatar5.jpg\" alt=\"Matthieu\"/></div><div class=\"chefs-avatar\"><img src=\"/chefs/avatar6.jpg\" alt=\"Colette\"/></div><div class=\"chefs-avatar\"><img src=\"/chefs/avatar7.jpg\" alt=\"Olivier\"/></div><div class=\"chefs-avatar\"><img src=\"/chefs/avatar8.jpg\" alt=\"Juliette\"/></div></div><div class=\"chefs-names\"><div class=\"chefs-name chefs-name--default\"><h1><span class=\"letter\">T</span><span class=\"letter\">h</span><span class=\"letter\">e</span><span class=\"letter\"> </span><span class=\"letter\">C</span><span class=\"letter\">h</span><span class=\"letter\">e</span><span class=\"letter\">f</span><span class=\"letter\">s</span></h1></div><div class=\"chefs-name\"><h1><span class=\"letter\">L</span><span class=\"letter\">a</span><span class=\"letter\">u</span><span class=\"letter\">r</span><span class=\"letter\">e</span><span class=\"letter\">n</span><span class=\"letter\">t</span></h1></div><div class=\"chefs-name\"><h1><span class=\"letter\">C</span><span class=\"letter\">a</span><span class=\"letter\">m</span><span class=\"letter\">i</span><span class=\"letter\">l</span><span class=\"letter\">l</span><span class=\"letter\">e</span></h1></div><div class=\"chefs-name\"><h1><span class=\"letter\">N</span><span class=\"letter\">i</span><span class=\"letter\">c</span><span class=\"letter\">o</span><span class=\"letter\">l</span><span class=\"letter\">a</span><span class=\"letter\">s</span></h1></div><div class=\"chefs-name\"><h1><span class=\"letter\">I</span><span class=\"letter\">s</span><span class=\"letter\">a</span><span class=\"letter\">b</span><span class=\"letter\">e</span><span class=\"letter\">l</span><span class=\"letter\">l</span><span class=\"letter\">e</span></h1></div><div class=\"chefs-name\"><h1><span class=\"letter\">M</span><span class=\"letter\">a</span><span class=\"letter\">t</span><span class=\"letter\">t</span><span class=\"letter\">h</span><span class=\"letter\">i</span><span class=\"letter\">e</span><span class=\"letter\">u</span></h1></div><div class=\"chefs-name\"><h1><span class=\"letter\">C</span><span class=\"letter\">o</span><span class=\"letter\">l</span><span class=\"letter\">e</span><span class=\"letter\">t</span><span class=\"letter\">t</span><span class=\"letter\">e</span></h1></div><div class=\"chefs-name\"><h1><span class=\"letter\">O</span><span class=\"letter\">l</span><span class=\"letter\">i</span><span class=\"letter\">v</span><span class=\"letter\">i</span><span class=\"letter\">e</span><span class=\"letter\">r</span></h1></div><div class=\"chefs-name\"><h1><span class=\"letter\">J</span><span class=\"letter\">u</span><span class=\"letter\">l</span><span class=\"letter\">i</span><span class=\"letter\">e</span><span class=\"letter\">t</span><span class=\"letter\">t</span><span class=\"letter\">e</span></h1></div></div><div class=\"section-footer\"><p class=\"sm\">Craft &amp; Technique</p><p class=\"sm\">Fire &amp; Form</p></div></section><section class=\"cta\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"cta-content\"><h6>A table awaits</h6><h5>Settle into a space where the pace softens and each course arrives with quiet intention.</h5><div class=\"cta-details\"><div class=\"cta-address\"><div data-copy-wrapper=\"true\"><p class=\"mono\">West End</p><p class=\"mono\">Greenville, SC</p></div></div><div class=\"cta-hours\"><div data-copy-wrapper=\"true\"><p class=\"mono\">LUN–VEN 19:00–23:00</p><p class=\"mono\">SAB–DOM 18:30–23:30</p></div></div></div><div class=\"cta-circle-button\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"cta-button\"><svg class=\"cta-button-svg\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\"><path d=\"M50,10 A40,40 0 1,1 49.9999,10\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0.75\" fill=\"none\"></path></svg><span>Take a Table</span></a></div></div><div class=\"cta-image\"><img src=\"/cta/cta-img.jpg\" alt=\"Restaurant interior\"/></div></div></section><!--$--><!--/$--><footer class=\"footer\"><